# Allowlist: nothing goes into the image unless it is listed here.
# This keeps .env, .git, the raw data, caches and your notes out by default.
# If you add a file the app needs at runtime, add it below.
*

!requirements.txt
!api.py
!ask.py
!graph/build_graph.py
!graph/visualize.py
!web/
!data/processed/graph.json

# never, even inside the folders allowed above
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
